      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.direction.sazanami.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.asset.sprite.sazanami",
        "actorId": "sazanami",
        "slot": "center",
        "scale": "compact"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの人波を、涼しい水音がついてくる。さざなみは、携帯水槽で歩く人だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "水槽の中から、泡の文字で会話する。屋台を通るたび、泡がぽこぽこと立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「たこ焼き 六十八点」「りんご飴 七十一点」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "採点は、彼女の愛情表現だ。辛口なのは、ちゃんと見ている証拠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ちなみに私の去年の弁当は、四十二点だった。今年は、六十点まで上がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "伸び代を褒める流儀なのだ、と信じている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "金魚すくいの屋台で、恒例の対決をした。私のポイは、三秒で破れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は水槽の中から、視線だけで金魚を誘導し、おじさんに出禁を言い渡された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「水の民の反則です」ごもっともだ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "通りの外れの噴水に、水槽を浸けて、休憩にした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜の水面が、祭りの灯りを砕いて揺れる。泡が、静かに立った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あした の しあい こわい?」……少し、と答えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、ほんの少し伏せていた。水の人に、嘘は通じない。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "泡が、ゆっくり続けた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「れきだい おうじゃ みんな みた」四百年、海からこの街の興行を見てきた人だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「かんぺき だった。てんすう つけやすかった」完璧は、採点しやすい。……なるほど。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「でも ミミ の あした は」泡が、一度ぜんぶ消えて、それから、大きな一文が浮かんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「さいてん ふのう」……不能? 「みたこと ない ものは てん が つけられない」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "何でも採点する人の、採点不能。それは、この人の辞書で、いちばん上等の点数だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "泡が照れたように、小さく続けた。「よんひゃくねん で はじめて」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……四百年ぶんの、白紙の採点表をもらってしまった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、水槽の水面に、最後の泡が立った。「あした うみ から おうえん する」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「なみ が たかかったら それ わたし」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……明日の会場、少し、潮の匂いがするかもしれない。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.sazanami.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
